        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>最经典也最常用的自动化手段是 <b>STA/LTA 能量比法</b>：用一个短时窗（STA）和一个长时窗（LTA）同时滑过波形，计算两个窗内能量的比值。信号没来时两者都接近噪声水平、比值在 1 附近；初至一到，短窗能量骤增，比值出现尖峰 —— 超过阈值的位置就是拾取的初至。</p><p>它替掉的是<b>逐道目视找初至</b>这一步，人只需要复核算法没有把握的低信噪比道。参数上：STA 取 5—15 个采样点、LTA 取 50—200 个，阈值 2—5，按资料信噪比调。天然地震监测里常用的设置是短窗 0.2 s、长窗 2.0 s，思路一致。</p><p>更现代的做法是用深度学习<b>逐采样点分类</b>（PhaseNet 类 U-Net）。公开对比很能说明差距：在北加州数据训练的 PhaseNet 上，P 波拾取误差 51.5 ms、传统 AIC 方法 138.8 ms；在 2024 年木里 M<sub>S</sub>5.0 震群目录构建中，PhaseNet 的 P 波平均绝对误差 <b>82.8 ms</b>、召回 0.80，STA/LTA 是 <b>217.6 ms</b>、召回 0.70。差距主要出现在低信噪比段 —— 正是人工最累、最容易出错的那部分。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 176\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"三种拾取结果\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"196\" height=\"136\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdfcf9\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\"/><text x=\"19\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#3a352d\" letter-spacing=\".8\">TP · 命中</text><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"192\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#f0ece1\"/><polyline points=\"20.0,72.0 21.9,69.4 23.9,74.6 25.8,71.9 27.7,69.4 29.7,74.6 31.6,71.9 33.5,69.5 35.5,74.7 37.4,71.8 39.3,69.5 41.3,74.7 43.2,71.8 45.1,69.5 47.1,74.7 49.0,71.7 50.9,69.5 52.9,74.7 54.8,71.7 56.7,69.6 58.7,74.7 60.6,71.6 62.5,69.6 64.4,74.8 66.4,71.6 68.3,69.6 70.2,74.8 72.2,71.5 74.1,69.7 76.0,74.8 78.0,71.5 79.9,69.7 81.8,74.8 83.8,71.4 85.7,69.7 87.6,74.8 89.6,71.4 91.5,69.8 93.4,74.9 95.4,71.3 97.3,69.8 99.2,74.9 101.2,71.3 103.1,69.8 105.0,74.9 107.0,59.4 108.9,59.7 110.8,76.8 112.8,81.9 114.7,77.4 116.6,71.8 118.6,61.8 120.5,64.7 122.4,78.8 124.4,79.1 126.3,73.4 128.2,70.7 130.2,64.3 132.1,68.1 134.0,79.3 136.0,76.5 137.9,70.9 139.8,70.8 141.8,66.6 143.7,70.1 145.6,78.9 147.6,74.2 149.5,69.5 151.4,71.4 153.3,68.4 155.3,71.2 157.2,78.1 159.1,72.5 161.1,68.9 163.0,72.3 164.9,69.7 166.9,71.7 168.8,77.2 170.7,71.4 172.7,68.9 174.6,73.2 176.5,70.4 178.5,71.7 180.4,76.4 182.3,70.6 184.3,69.1 186.2,73.9 188.1,70.8 190.1,71.6 192.0,75.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#31393d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"105.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"105.0\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#3a352d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"19\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">初至落在真值 ±2 采样点内</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"8\" width=\"196\" height=\"136\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdfcf9\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\"/><text x=\"223\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#b26a39\" letter-spacing=\".8\">FP · 假拾取</text><line x1=\"224\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"396\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#f0ece1\"/><polyline points=\"224.0,72.0 225.9,69.4 227.9,74.6 229.8,71.9 231.7,69.4 233.7,74.6 235.6,71.9 237.5,69.5 239.5,74.7 241.4,71.8 243.3,69.5 245.3,74.7 247.2,71.8 249.1,69.5 251.1,74.7 253.0,71.7 254.9,69.5 256.9,74.7 258.8,71.7 260.7,69.6 262.7,74.7 264.6,71.6 266.5,69.6 268.4,74.8 270.4,71.6 272.3,69.6 274.2,58.8 276.2,71.5 278.1,69.7 280.0,74.8 282.0,71.5 283.9,69.7 285.8,74.8 287.8,71.4 289.7,69.7 291.6,74.8 293.6,71.4 295.5,69.8 297.4,74.9 299.4,71.3 301.3,69.8 303.2,74.9 305.2,71.3 307.1,69.8 309.0,74.9 311.0,71.3 312.9,69.9 314.8,74.9 316.8,71.2 318.7,69.9 320.6,74.9 322.6,71.2 324.5,69.9 326.4,74.9 328.4,71.1 330.3,70.0 332.2,74.9 334.2,71.1 336.1,70.0 338.0,74.9 340.0,71.0 341.9,70.1 343.8,75.0 345.8,71.0 347.7,70.1 349.6,75.0 351.6,70.9 353.5,60.0 355.4,66.3 357.3,72.5 359.3,79.3 361.2,81.4 363.1,68.1 365.1,62.2 367.0,70.5 368.9,74.1 370.9,77.1 372.8,77.9 374.7,67.1 376.7,64.5 378.6,73.3 380.5,74.4 382.5,75.0 384.4,75.7 386.3,67.0 388.3,66.7 390.2,75.0 392.1,73.9 394.1,73.3 396.0,74.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#31393d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"274.2\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"274.2\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"223\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">噪声尖峰提前触发阈值</text><rect x=\"416\" y=\"8\" width=\"196\" height=\"136\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdfcf9\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\"/><text x=\"427\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#b05a51\" letter-spacing=\".8\">FN · 漏拾取</text><line x1=\"428\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"600\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#f0ece1\"/><polyline points=\"428.0,72.0 429.9,69.4 431.9,74.6 433.8,71.9 435.7,69.4 437.7,74.6 439.6,71.9 441.5,69.5 443.5,74.7 445.4,71.8 447.3,69.5 449.3,74.7 451.2,71.8 453.1,69.5 455.1,74.7 457.0,71.7 458.9,69.5 460.9,74.7 462.8,71.7 464.7,69.6 466.7,74.7 468.6,71.6 470.5,69.6 472.4,74.8 474.4,71.6 476.3,69.6 478.2,74.8 480.2,71.5 482.1,69.7 484.0,74.8 486.0,71.5 487.9,69.7 489.8,74.8 491.8,71.4 493.7,69.7 495.6,74.8 497.6,71.4 499.5,69.8 501.4,74.9 503.4,71.3 505.3,69.8 507.2,74.9 509.2,71.3 511.1,69.8 513.0,74.9 515.0,67.0 516.9,66.2 518.8,75.6 520.8,75.1 522.7,72.7 524.6,73.8 526.6,67.7 528.5,68.0 530.4,76.4 532.4,74.1 534.3,71.3 536.2,73.3 538.2,68.5 540.1,69.3 542.0,76.6 544.0,73.1 545.9,70.4 547.8,73.3 549.8,69.2 551.7,70.1 553.6,76.5 555.6,72.3 557.5,69.9 559.4,73.5 561.3,69.9 563.3,70.6 565.2,76.3 567.1,71.5 569.1,69.7 571.0,73.9 572.9,70.3 574.9,70.9 576.8,75.9 578.7,71.0 580.7,69.7 582.6,74.2 584.5,70.6 586.5,70.9 588.4,75.6 590.3,70.6 592.3,69.8 594.2,74.5 596.1,70.7 598.1,71.0 600.0,75.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#31393d\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"544.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"544.0\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#b05a51\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"427\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#79828a\">弱信号达不到阈值</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 2</b><span>三种典型结果：命中（左）、噪声尖峰导致的假拾取（中）、弱信号导致的漏拾取（右）。<b>假拾取比漏拾取更隐蔽</b> —— 它在剖面上表现为一条孤立的跳点，不做空间一致性检查很难发现。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">立项前先对着这张清单打勾。<b>勾不满不代表不能做</b>，但每一项空缺都会在后期变成返工。清单可点击，勾选状态只在本页有效。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">单炮道集</span><span class=\"cl-s\">SGY / SEGD，保留采样率与道头</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">一切计算的基础</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">观测系统</span><span class=\"cl-s\">炮点、检波点坐标与偏移距</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">空间一致性约束要用</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">低降速带资料</span><span class=\"cl-s\">微测井、小折射</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">验证静校正效果</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">人工抽检</span><span class=\"cl-s\">5%—10% 道，逐道拾取</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">统计误差分布，不用于训练</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">处理参数</span><span class=\"cl-s\">带通滤波频带、反褶积参数</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">滤波会移动初至，必须统一</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可参考的公开数据与基准</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><span class=\"ref\">PhaseNet 拾取误差基准（51.5 vs 138.8 ms）</span><span class=\"ref\">木里 MS5.0 震群：PhaseNet 82.8 ms vs STA/LTA 217.6 ms</span><span class=\"ref\">公开三分量波形库（用于预训练）</span></div><p style=\"margin-top:14px\" class=\"small muted\">口径提醒：<b>采样点</b>与<b>毫秒</b>必须写清换算（2 ms 采样时 1 点 = 2 ms）；<b>误差</b>要说明是相对人工基准还是相对理论走时；<b>拾取点</b>取起跳点还是峰值，全测线要一致。</p>"
        },
